  - m_Id: 14408695812
    m_Localized: The store is currently unavailable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695813
    m_Localized: Welcome aboard, Commander! Your ship is almost ready for its first
      battle, but one gun is still missing. Tap Build to open the ship builder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695814
    m_Localized: Blocks are sorted into categories. Tap Weapons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695815
    m_Localized: Drag the gun onto the free spot of your ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695816
    m_Localized: Tap the check mark to confirm the build.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695817
    m_Localized: Well done! Tap Save to keep your new ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695818
    m_Localized: Your ship is saved. Now leave the builder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695819
    m_Localized: Your ship is ready for battle. Tap Play!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695820
    m_Localized: Choose Campaign.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695821
    m_Localized: Select the first star system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695822
    m_Localized: Tap level 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695823
    m_Localized: Tap Play to launch the battle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695824
    m_Localized: You've completed a task! Open Rewards to collect your prize.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695825
    m_Localized: Tap Claim to get your reward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695826
    m_Localized: You have enough research points to unlock shields! Open Research.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695827
    m_Localized: Tap the shield to research it. Shields stop enemy shots before they
      hit your ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14408695828
    m_Localized: 'Move your finger on the joystick to fly your ship. Your guns fire
      on their own: dodge enemy shots and destroy every enemy!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
